WEBVTT

01:31.429 --> 01:33.536
[Episode 14]

01:47.008 --> 01:51.808
[Censorate]

02:24.840 --> 02:25.840
Hurry up.

02:25.840 --> 02:27.780
Be gentle. My leg!

02:31.560 --> 02:32.560
Master,

02:32.560 --> 02:34.120
when I was following Meng Ting Hui,

02:34.120 --> 02:36.039
I found this cripple was also following her.

02:36.039 --> 02:37.599
He's the doorman at our gambling house.

02:37.599 --> 02:39.759
Last time Meng Ting Hui
went to the gambling house,

02:39.759 --> 02:40.960
it was him who spotted her.

02:40.960 --> 02:44.620
He told me he has a way
to bring down Meng Ting Hui.

02:45.280 --> 02:47.400
Who exactly are you?

02:47.400 --> 02:51.479
Master, I am Meng Ting Hui's enemy.

02:51.479 --> 02:53.800
I knew her ten years ago.

02:53.800 --> 02:56.520
She crippled my leg!

02:56.520 --> 03:00.840
Because of Meng Ting Hui,
I became a cripple despised by everyone.

03:00.840 --> 03:02.080
I changed my name,

03:02.080 --> 03:03.842
and was driven from my hometown.

03:03.842 --> 03:04.879
For the past ten years,

03:04.879 --> 03:06.400
I haven't been able to sleep a single night.

03:06.400 --> 03:09.599
I long to eat her flesh
and drink her blood, Master!

03:09.599 --> 03:12.360
My hatred for that shameless woman
is no less than yours.

03:12.360 --> 03:14.319
I want to join the Huxiao Gang.

03:14.319 --> 03:16.319
With you as my backer,

03:16.319 --> 03:18.219
I will eliminate her for you.

03:20.639 --> 03:22.080
I have investigated.

03:22.080 --> 03:26.259
This man indeed trafficked children
in Shazhou ten years ago.

03:40.960 --> 03:42.919
A person who dares to sell children

03:42.919 --> 03:44.960
is not worthy to bargain with me.

03:44.960 --> 03:46.520
Spare me, Master!

03:46.520 --> 03:49.319
Back then, I was indeed blinded by greed.

03:49.319 --> 03:50.759
I deserve to die.

03:50.759 --> 03:52.180
But, Master,

03:53.000 --> 03:57.479
Meng Ting Hui's closest sister died
at my hands.

03:57.479 --> 04:00.120
I know what she fears and what she hates.

04:00.120 --> 04:02.520
With me here, we can bring her down.

04:02.520 --> 04:04.900
Master, please give me a chance.

04:05.800 --> 04:07.139
Fine.

04:08.439 --> 04:10.580
I'll let you go then.

04:11.439 --> 04:12.439
Remember.

04:12.439 --> 04:16.600
You are just a cripple driven mad by revenge.

04:16.600 --> 04:20.240
You have nothing whatsoever to do
with the Huxiao Gang.

04:20.240 --> 04:21.740
Thank you, Master.

04:36.199 --> 04:37.199
Wait.

04:37.199 --> 04:39.759
You only add salt
when the meat turns golden brown.

04:39.759 --> 04:41.079
Miss Yan,

04:41.079 --> 04:44.000
this is the authentic
Beijian roasting method.

04:44.000 --> 04:47.279
What do you know
compared to us Shazhou locals?

04:47.279 --> 04:49.100
Meng, you be the judge.

04:52.240 --> 04:54.980
Meng, why are you so distracted?

04:55.839 --> 04:57.399
It's nothing.

04:57.399 --> 04:58.879
Perhaps, I've been a bit tired lately,

04:58.879 --> 05:00.279
so I'm feeling unsettled.

05:00.279 --> 05:02.199
Then you should relax
and enjoy yourself today.

05:02.199 --> 05:04.480
Mr. Shen spared no expense today.

05:04.480 --> 05:06.319
He arranged a grand feast
to celebrate your success.

05:06.319 --> 05:08.480
Holding the banquet here at your place,

05:08.480 --> 05:10.680
his intention
is probably not just about the celebration.

05:10.680 --> 05:12.600
There are so many restaurants
on Changle Street.

05:12.600 --> 05:14.319
But he chose your Bofeng House specifically.

05:14.319 --> 05:16.740
His affection is quite weighty.

05:17.843 --> 05:19.804
That's because I have the best view

05:19.804 --> 05:21.363
and the best barbecue here.

05:21.363 --> 05:25.204
Other than his pretty face, what else
does Shen Zhi Shu have going for him?

05:25.204 --> 05:26.764
He spends all day flirting around

05:26.764 --> 05:28.764
and just looks completely unreliable.

05:28.764 --> 05:31.840
Last time... Last time,
I even saw him at Huiyin House...

05:31.840 --> 05:35.084
You even remember clearly
what kind of women he flirted with last time.

05:35.084 --> 05:36.084
You!

05:36.921 --> 05:40.042
I just felt bad for the ladies of the capital.

05:40.042 --> 05:42.602
Ms. Yan, talking behind someone's back
comes with consequences.

05:42.602 --> 05:44.842
Just now, you clearly praised my good looks.

05:44.842 --> 05:46.342
Mr. Shen, you're here.

05:47.241 --> 05:48.522
Greetings, Your Majesty.

05:48.522 --> 05:50.082
- Your Majesty.
- No need for formalities.

05:50.082 --> 05:51.642
I brought some good wine today

05:51.642 --> 05:53.361
to celebrate with you.

05:53.361 --> 05:54.741
You may all rise.

05:56.962 --> 05:58.962
I don't know what's wrong with my legs.

05:58.962 --> 06:00.681
Whenever I see Your Majesty,
they just won't obey me.

06:00.681 --> 06:02.082
They just want to kneel and kowtow.

06:02.082 --> 06:04.241
Shen Zhi Shu, why didn't you tell me
His Majesty is here?

06:04.241 --> 06:05.962
Although I am the one
who invited all of you today,

06:05.962 --> 06:08.881
it was by His Majesty's will
that we are here to commend Miss Meng.

06:08.881 --> 06:11.801
Lately, Lord Xu has been sending noble ladies
into the palace

06:11.801 --> 06:13.109
for the Empress selection.

06:13.109 --> 06:15.162
- His Majesty wanted to escape the hassle.
- Enough.

06:15.162 --> 06:16.262
Let's eat.

06:17.441 --> 06:18.762
The mutton is ready.

06:18.762 --> 06:20.241
And some side dishes from my hometown.

06:20.241 --> 06:21.280
Everyone, please try some.

06:21.280 --> 06:24.022
His Majesty wouldn't dare
to taste something you made.

06:25.921 --> 06:28.262
Then how about we taste the dishes
for His Majesty first?

06:35.082 --> 06:37.241
Fresh and tasty.

06:37.241 --> 06:38.681
It's delicious.

06:38.681 --> 06:40.162
Miss Meng truly has excellent taste.

06:40.162 --> 06:41.582
I like it too.

06:52.880 --> 06:54.402
What is this?

06:54.402 --> 06:57.561
- Yin Qing, how dare you poison His Majesty!
- No, no!

06:57.561 --> 06:59.921
This is called fishy herb. It's edible.

06:59.921 --> 07:02.241
Look, Miss Meng is clearly enjoying it.

07:02.241 --> 07:05.821
Perhaps His Majesty and Miss Meng
have vastly...

07:06.441 --> 07:07.741
different tastes.

07:08.681 --> 07:10.801
Huang Bo, bring the wine.

07:10.801 --> 07:12.121
Wait.

07:12.121 --> 07:14.481
The weather has been getting cooler lately.

07:14.481 --> 07:17.602
I brewed some fruit wine myself.
Let me bring it for you to try.

07:17.602 --> 07:18.941
Great!

07:38.361 --> 07:39.501
My turn.

07:42.361 --> 07:45.481
This fruit wine can nourish your complexion

07:45.481 --> 07:48.102
and make you glow.

07:50.001 --> 07:54.881
But for Miss Meng and Miss Yan,

07:54.881 --> 07:56.642
the effect is quite ordinary.

07:56.642 --> 07:58.162
Why?

07:58.162 --> 08:01.821
Because you two are naturally beautiful!

08:16.481 --> 08:17.881
Yin Qing,

08:17.881 --> 08:20.402
you've been running around non-stop.

08:20.402 --> 08:21.481
Take a seat and rest for a while.

08:21.481 --> 08:22.542
Alright.

08:23.481 --> 08:26.722
The mutton is getting a bit cold.
It needs to be reheated.

08:26.722 --> 08:28.022
I'll do it.

08:35.321 --> 08:36.841
The fruit wine is also cold.

08:36.841 --> 08:37.921
Take it and warm it up.

08:37.921 --> 08:40.101
Alright, here I go again.

08:42.841 --> 08:45.262
Yin Qing, let me help you.

08:48.921 --> 08:51.282
How can your skills compare to his?

08:51.282 --> 08:52.382
Sit.

09:06.642 --> 09:08.601
Your Majesty, if you have an issue with me,

09:08.601 --> 09:10.101
please speak frankly.

09:10.801 --> 09:12.522
When have I ever had any issue with you?

09:12.522 --> 09:14.762
Then why are you making things difficult
for my colleague?

09:14.762 --> 09:16.382
You call that making things difficult?

09:18.402 --> 09:19.921
It seems that Director Meng

09:19.921 --> 09:22.262
cares far more about her colleague
than about me.

09:29.321 --> 09:30.841
Your Majesty.

09:30.841 --> 09:32.122
Changle Street is too bustling,

09:32.122 --> 09:34.482
and the heavy traffic caused a delay.
I apologize for keeping you waiting.

09:34.482 --> 09:37.402
It's my fault. I took a little time
to freshen up and lost track of time.

09:37.402 --> 09:39.042
Take a seat and try the Shazhou specialties.

09:39.042 --> 09:40.742
Come on. Sit over here.

09:42.362 --> 09:43.362
I know you don't like ginger.

09:43.362 --> 09:44.882
There isn't any onion or garlic in it.

09:44.882 --> 09:46.362
You'll definitely like it.

09:46.362 --> 09:47.601
Thank you, Yin Qing.

09:47.601 --> 09:49.742
You're the best and the most considerate.

09:51.122 --> 09:54.042
To think there's someone
who knows Zhi Li better than you.

09:54.042 --> 09:55.042
However,

09:55.042 --> 09:57.002
it's good for Zhi Li
to spend more time with Yin Qing.

09:57.002 --> 09:59.982
After all, she's a young lady.
It's better than being close to her teacher.

10:02.282 --> 10:04.122
Zhi Li, Captain Di.

10:04.122 --> 10:06.122
You're late,
so you have to drink three cups as a penalty.

10:06.122 --> 10:07.162
Alright.

10:07.162 --> 10:09.522
I'll drink on Zhi Li's behalf.

10:09.522 --> 10:10.941
No need to drink for her.

10:11.801 --> 10:13.801
Captain Di, please sit.

10:13.801 --> 10:16.801
This is my homemade fruit wine.

10:16.801 --> 10:18.081
It's good for your skin.

10:18.081 --> 10:20.262
Do you know
that Zhi Li can't hold her liquor?

10:26.841 --> 10:29.122
Today is a celebration,
so naturally, we should enjoy ourselves.

10:29.122 --> 10:32.341
Tomorrow, we will definitely find a lead
on the Huxiao Gang.

10:34.482 --> 10:38.101
Then let's toast to a smooth day tomorrow.

10:39.081 --> 10:41.862
Cheers!

10:59.762 --> 11:01.801
Miss Meng, you sit high above.

11:01.801 --> 11:03.961
Of course,
you can talk nobly about conscience here.

11:03.961 --> 11:05.662
But for people like us,

11:06.601 --> 11:10.862
kindness only kills us sooner.

11:15.242 --> 11:17.542
Do you really think
claiming you had no choice

11:18.242 --> 11:20.841
justifies being an accomplice to evil?

11:20.841 --> 11:22.341
We are both women.

11:23.002 --> 11:25.402
You witnessed those girls
being pushed into the fire pit.

11:25.402 --> 11:27.522
You heard them crying and begging for help,

11:27.522 --> 11:29.601
yet you could still smile
and hand the whip to those people.

11:29.601 --> 11:31.982
Yue was only 18.

11:32.681 --> 11:34.561
She was tortured to death.

11:34.561 --> 11:36.622
Have you ever had nightmares
in the middle of the night?

11:40.321 --> 11:41.662
Nightmares?

11:49.321 --> 11:50.581
Miss Meng,

11:51.362 --> 11:55.362
this is what your so-called conscience
brought me.

11:55.362 --> 11:58.961
I was only 14
when I was sold into that place.

11:58.961 --> 12:01.821
They tortured me like an animal.

12:03.522 --> 12:05.681
I was locked
in the dungeon of the gambling house.

12:05.681 --> 12:07.921
They tied me to an iron stake.

12:07.921 --> 12:10.561
For an entire month, they drugged me.

12:10.561 --> 12:14.841
Then they hung me naked
from the second floor of the gambling house.

12:14.841 --> 12:16.841
All the gamblers were invited to place bets

12:16.841 --> 12:19.022
on which day I would beg for mercy.

12:20.282 --> 12:22.341
Do you think I had a choice?

12:24.841 --> 12:26.421
Either submit,

12:27.522 --> 12:29.561
or die.

12:29.561 --> 12:31.421
I didn't want to die.

12:32.242 --> 12:33.821
I wanted to live.

12:35.921 --> 12:39.101
Even if I lived like a ghost,
I still wanted to live.

12:40.601 --> 12:42.282
Was I wrong?

12:42.282 --> 12:43.601
Miss Meng,

12:43.601 --> 12:46.421
not everyone deserves to live

12:47.081 --> 12:49.221
as pure and unblemished as you.

13:11.042 --> 13:15.242
Come clean about the shady business
between the gambling house and Huxiao Gang.

13:15.242 --> 13:18.902
I swear on my life
that I'll settle this blood score for you.

13:19.882 --> 13:23.002
Fu Meng, you still hate them, right?

13:23.002 --> 13:24.921
You hate those who made you like this.

13:24.921 --> 13:27.522
But now, by continuing to aid the tyrant,

13:27.522 --> 13:29.961
you are stabbing your past self.

13:29.961 --> 13:32.081
If Hao Wen Ming
truly considered you one of his own,

13:32.081 --> 13:34.681
why are you still locked up
in the gambling house now?

13:34.681 --> 13:38.681
Fu Meng, you know their methods
better than anyone.

13:38.681 --> 13:40.122
Just speak out.

13:40.122 --> 13:43.642
Have you ever thought about what they fear?

13:43.642 --> 13:48.181
What they fear most is people like you
standing up to testify against them.

13:50.921 --> 13:52.902
But I truly know nothing

13:54.002 --> 13:56.122
about what you want to know.

13:56.122 --> 14:00.801
Hao Wen Ming never let us underlings
meddle in the affairs of the Huxiao Gang.

14:00.801 --> 14:03.162
We were only responsible for some odd jobs
in the gambling house

14:03.162 --> 14:04.882
and sending those girls to the chambers.

14:04.882 --> 14:06.921
So I've never met anyone from Huxiao Gang.

14:06.921 --> 14:09.801
You're Hao Wen Ming's most capable assistant.

14:09.801 --> 14:11.042
Still playing dumb?

14:11.042 --> 14:14.162
Hao Wen Ming acted extremely cautiously.

14:14.162 --> 14:17.982
And at this point,
what else do I have to hide?

14:18.642 --> 14:20.801
I'm dead either way.

14:20.801 --> 14:24.282
Let me serve the girls and atone
on the road to the underworld.

14:24.282 --> 14:28.502
I will go kowtow to them and confess my sins.

14:31.042 --> 14:32.221
My lady,

14:32.921 --> 14:35.701
we can only make a breakthrough
with Hao Wen Ming.

14:45.522 --> 14:48.002
Wen Ming, you're awake.

14:48.002 --> 14:50.282
Fu Meng has already spilled everything
about the shady business

14:50.282 --> 14:52.362
between Xingrong Gambling House
and the Huxiao Gang.

14:52.362 --> 14:54.681
If you can tell us something new,

14:54.681 --> 14:56.762
you might just keep your life.

14:56.762 --> 14:58.622
What does she know?

15:00.122 --> 15:03.662
You two brats are just bluffing.

15:14.601 --> 15:17.162
Under severe torture, there will be cowards.

15:17.162 --> 15:19.520
Under a hefty reward,
there will be brave men.

15:19.520 --> 15:22.282
Care to gamble your life?

15:22.282 --> 15:24.561
Let's see if Huxiao Gang comes to rescue you

15:24.561 --> 15:27.421
or silence you for keeping your mouth shut.

15:28.282 --> 15:30.762
Spill every single detail
you know about Ling Yun Fei,

15:30.762 --> 15:33.162
and name every corrupt official

15:33.162 --> 15:35.162
Huxiao Gang is colluding with in the court.

15:35.162 --> 15:38.022
Hao Wen Ming,
you may still have a chance to survive.

15:40.122 --> 15:43.482
My lady, why waste words on him?

15:43.482 --> 15:46.042
He thinks he's a tough nut to crack

15:46.042 --> 15:48.341
because he hasn't tasted the hot iron yet.

16:01.282 --> 16:03.801
I...

16:03.801 --> 16:05.601
I'll confess!

16:05.601 --> 16:07.921
I'll confess everything!

16:07.921 --> 16:10.902
I'll write down everything I know.

16:19.601 --> 16:20.701
Someone!

16:30.482 --> 16:31.482
Get the physician.

16:31.482 --> 16:32.542
Yes!

16:35.801 --> 16:38.321
You would rather die than speak?

16:38.321 --> 16:39.782
I'm afraid of death.

16:41.402 --> 16:43.542
But I'm more afraid of Ling Yun Fei.

16:45.362 --> 16:46.982
A traitor's

16:48.961 --> 16:50.742
entire family will be buried with him.

16:51.402 --> 16:54.042
That's the rule of the Huxiao Gang.

16:54.042 --> 16:56.461
The day I got on board,

16:58.282 --> 17:00.461
I had already written my will

17:01.961 --> 17:03.362
for my wife and children.

17:03.362 --> 17:05.661
All you have to do
is step forward and testify,

17:06.361 --> 17:08.962
and I can wipe Huxiao Gang off the map!

17:08.962 --> 17:10.262
Miss Meng,

17:13.482 --> 17:16.801
you are good people.

17:16.801 --> 17:20.922
This is what I deserve for my sins.

17:20.922 --> 17:22.782
You can't fight him.

17:24.442 --> 17:25.861
Besides,

17:26.841 --> 17:28.101
what you are fighting

17:29.321 --> 17:33.002
has never been just him alone.

17:33.002 --> 17:34.301
Who else?

17:35.121 --> 17:36.542
Tell me!

17:39.801 --> 17:41.022
Miss Meng,

17:41.682 --> 17:44.262
I... I beg you.

17:46.042 --> 17:47.821
For the sake of my family,

17:48.561 --> 17:49.821
just say

17:50.841 --> 17:52.821
I didn't confess anything.

17:55.762 --> 17:56.762
Where's the physician?

17:56.762 --> 17:57.942
Physician!

17:58.762 --> 17:59.982
Hao Wen Ming!

18:38.682 --> 18:40.282
You've been working hard on the case
these days.

18:40.282 --> 18:41.922
You haven't even had a proper meal.

18:41.922 --> 18:43.682
Put official business aside for tonight.

18:43.682 --> 18:46.641
Try the new signature dish
at my Bofeng House.

18:46.641 --> 18:47.782
Alright.

18:49.641 --> 18:51.042
There are many guests today.

18:51.042 --> 18:52.401
I'll go attend to the front hall now.

18:52.401 --> 18:54.841
You all must eat well.

18:54.841 --> 18:55.841
Okay.

18:55.841 --> 18:57.301
Especially you.

19:06.242 --> 19:07.801
I have no appetite.

19:07.801 --> 19:09.682
We couldn't even bluff it out of him.

19:09.682 --> 19:11.121
Fu Meng said

19:11.121 --> 19:14.522
that Hao Wen Ming was the only one
in contact with the Huxiao Gang.

19:14.522 --> 19:17.361
Now that Hao Wen Ming is dead,
all leads are cut off.

19:17.361 --> 19:19.042
Ling Yun Fei has vanished without a trace.

19:19.042 --> 19:23.182
Just who exactly is pulling the strings
behind him?

19:24.801 --> 19:26.641
I suspected before

19:26.641 --> 19:30.881
that this cross mark left by Wan Kai
might be related to an identity.

19:30.881 --> 19:33.228
Hao Wen Ming also deliberately mentioned
before he died

19:33.228 --> 19:35.401
that I'm not just
fighting against Ling Yun Fei.

19:35.401 --> 19:38.401
Lv Er also mentioned the person behind him
before he died.

19:38.401 --> 19:42.982
Did these three point to the same person?

19:44.841 --> 19:46.482
It's possible.

19:46.482 --> 19:50.301
Could this cross be a radical?

19:51.042 --> 19:52.042
Xiang.

19:52.042 --> 19:54.682
Could it refer to the Chancellor?

19:54.682 --> 19:56.561
Someone with overwhelming power.

19:56.561 --> 19:58.722
It's very likely to be the Left Chancellor.

19:58.722 --> 20:00.002
A horizontal stroke, a vertical stroke,
and a mouth radical,

20:00.002 --> 20:02.161
it becomes Gu,
which could be the Right Chancellor.

20:02.161 --> 20:03.682
Absolutely impossible.

20:03.682 --> 20:05.242
I know my master well.

20:05.242 --> 20:08.042
He is not a sinister and deceitful villain
who would conspire with Ling Yun Fei.

20:08.042 --> 20:10.081
I'll vouch for him with my honor.

20:10.081 --> 20:12.841
I was just speculating. Why so serious?

20:12.841 --> 20:14.242
That's not speculation at all.

20:14.242 --> 20:15.361
It's nonsense.

20:15.361 --> 20:17.301
Zhi Li has a point.

20:18.522 --> 20:20.762
Without solid evidence,

20:20.762 --> 20:22.702
any suspicion is just speculation.

20:25.321 --> 20:28.401
To uncover the truth,
we must find Ling Yun Fei.

20:28.401 --> 20:31.840
Other shops on Changle Street
might also be connected to the Huxiao Gang.

20:31.840 --> 20:34.601
As long as there's a sliver of possibility,
we can't let it go.

20:34.601 --> 20:35.682
Yes.

20:35.682 --> 20:38.042
Then let's eat properly.

20:38.042 --> 20:39.262
Especially you.

20:52.360 --> 20:53.922
Ms. Yan,

20:53.922 --> 20:55.841
is Miss Meng here today?

20:55.841 --> 20:58.601
Can we meet Miss Meng?

20:58.601 --> 21:00.042
Meet Meng?

21:00.042 --> 21:04.282
Yes, Miss Meng wiped out
the evil Xingrong Gambling House

21:04.282 --> 21:05.762
and saved so many women.

21:05.762 --> 21:07.561
- She's a true hero.
- Ms. Yan.

21:07.561 --> 21:08.601
You're here too?

21:08.601 --> 21:10.401
Excuse me, please.

21:10.401 --> 21:12.561
Ms. Yan, though you and Miss Meng
are not real sisters,

21:12.561 --> 21:14.321
you are closer than real sisters.

21:14.321 --> 21:16.522
Having such a friend is truly enviable.

21:16.522 --> 21:18.442
Ms. Yan, we came here
because of her reputation.

21:18.442 --> 21:21.081
Could you pull some strings
and let us meet Miss Meng?

21:21.081 --> 21:23.401
Yes, let us meet Miss Meng too.

21:23.401 --> 21:24.881
Everyone, please be patient.

21:24.881 --> 21:27.601
Miss Meng is busy today
and shouldn't be disturbed.

21:27.601 --> 21:30.801
However, I will personally cook today
to entertain you all.

21:30.801 --> 21:32.581
- Alright.
- Please come inside.

21:33.320 --> 21:35.260
We can taste Ms. Yan's cooking.

21:42.240 --> 21:46.144
[Bofeng House]

22:41.042 --> 22:43.301
Meng, what's wrong?

22:43.962 --> 22:45.682
Meng.

22:45.682 --> 22:49.101
Meng, take a seat first. Slowly.

22:55.722 --> 22:56.722
Meng,

22:56.722 --> 22:58.282
I boiled some sugarcane juice.

22:58.282 --> 23:00.601
It can nourish the blood, moisten dryness,
and benefit the spleen and stomach.

23:00.601 --> 23:01.821
Drink more.

23:09.522 --> 23:12.841
Meng, Bofeng House was so lively today.
So many people came.

23:12.841 --> 23:14.322
They all came because of your fame.

23:14.322 --> 23:17.028
They said you are a hero of the Ning Empire.

23:21.202 --> 23:22.901
The more they praise me,

23:27.121 --> 23:28.942
the worse I feel.

23:30.641 --> 23:33.361
Now that all leads on the Huxiao Gang
are cut off,

23:33.361 --> 23:35.462
if we can't catch Ling Yun Fei,

23:36.202 --> 23:39.661
all the praise
will eventually turn into curses.

23:40.920 --> 23:43.779
Sometimes, you can't put too much pressure
on yourself.

23:51.841 --> 23:53.022
Fu Zhi,

23:53.881 --> 23:57.101
I am no longer that orphan girl
with nothing in Shazhou.

23:58.442 --> 24:00.841
Now, I wear official robes

24:00.841 --> 24:03.080
and carry the expectations of the people.

24:03.080 --> 24:06.502
I know full well where Censorate's lantern
should be pointed.

24:07.881 --> 24:10.242
The Huxiao Gang must be eliminated.

24:10.242 --> 24:12.242
So that those desperate people in the corners

24:12.242 --> 24:14.361
can have a little more hope.

24:14.361 --> 24:16.962
Of course, I believe in you.

24:16.962 --> 24:19.121
But you must promise me.

24:19.121 --> 24:20.641
When holding an umbrella for others,

24:20.641 --> 24:22.702
you must protect yourself first.

24:30.202 --> 24:32.121
- I have to go now.
- Where?

24:32.121 --> 24:34.762
I'll return to the palace
and report to His Majesty about this,

24:34.762 --> 24:37.141
just to prevent him from suspecting
that I'm withholding information.

24:45.682 --> 24:47.101
Miss Meng.

24:50.801 --> 24:52.042
Miss Meng.

24:52.042 --> 24:56.262
I am here today to propose marriage
and take you as my bride.

24:57.202 --> 24:58.841
Miss Meng.

24:58.841 --> 25:01.782
So you don't even know who Miss Meng is yet?

25:05.561 --> 25:08.601
Then this must be Miss Meng.

25:08.601 --> 25:11.600
I didn't expect you
to be even more gorgeous than the rumors say.

25:11.600 --> 25:13.340
I am determined to marry you.

25:14.442 --> 25:15.581
Stop.

25:25.762 --> 25:27.202
You?

25:27.202 --> 25:28.422
Who are you?

25:29.161 --> 25:30.801
I stand by my name

25:30.801 --> 25:32.101
with absolute pride.

25:32.101 --> 25:34.482
Xu Ting, the Left Chancellor, is my father.

25:34.482 --> 25:38.182
I am his only son, Xu Run Ze.

25:40.841 --> 25:41.922
Miss Meng,

25:41.922 --> 25:43.002
trust me.

25:43.002 --> 25:44.401
If we get married,

25:44.401 --> 25:46.522
we'll be a match made in heaven.
I'm talented, and you're good-looking.

25:46.522 --> 25:48.641
No, wait. You are talented,
and I'm good-looking.

25:48.641 --> 25:50.282
Keep your distance.

25:50.282 --> 25:51.442
Mr. Xu,

25:51.442 --> 25:54.561
does your father know
you're out here embarrassing yourself?

25:54.561 --> 25:55.801
My father said,

25:55.801 --> 25:57.641
"A real man

25:57.641 --> 26:00.422
must forge ahead courageously
once he sets his sights on something."

26:01.121 --> 26:03.502
Oh, right.
I've even written the marriage contract.

26:05.161 --> 26:09.242
I, Xu Run Ze, dashing and debonair,

26:09.242 --> 26:10.722
wish to wed Meng Ting Hui,

26:10.722 --> 26:13.641
a woman
of breathtaking beauty and brilliant mind.

26:13.641 --> 26:17.022
For the rest of my life,
you are my one and only.

26:18.520 --> 26:20.121
Thank you all for your support.

26:20.121 --> 26:23.881
I'll cover all the expenses
at Bofeng House today.

26:23.881 --> 26:25.641
Everyone, enjoy yourselves.

26:25.641 --> 26:26.840
Great!

26:26.840 --> 26:29.361
- Eat more! Everyone, sit!
- Yan Fu Zhi.

26:29.361 --> 26:30.841
Mr. Xu,

26:30.841 --> 26:32.321
I have never met you before.

26:32.321 --> 26:33.682
What gave you the idea
that we are getting married?

26:33.682 --> 26:35.442
Please leave Bofeng House immediately.

26:35.442 --> 26:38.002
I think Mr. Xu has studied himself stupid.

26:38.002 --> 26:40.321
No. My father said

26:40.321 --> 26:42.401
I'm stupid because I've read too little.

26:42.401 --> 26:44.682
So I need to find a talented woman
to improve the bloodline.

26:44.682 --> 26:47.722
Miss Meng, just consider it
for the sake of my future descendants.

26:47.722 --> 26:49.522
- Marry me.
- Mr. Xu,

26:49.522 --> 26:51.321
please stop making fun of me.

26:51.321 --> 26:53.561
Miss Meng, I am completely serious
about marrying you.

26:53.561 --> 26:56.321
My family not only has power and influence,
but also wealth.

26:56.321 --> 26:57.880
You don't need to worry
about not being a match for me.

26:57.880 --> 27:00.482
I don't care about family background
when choosing a wife.

27:00.482 --> 27:02.861
As long as she's smart and well-read
like you.

27:03.881 --> 27:04.881
Someone!

27:04.881 --> 27:07.401
Bring all the betrothal gifts inside.

27:07.401 --> 27:09.321
Put them down! Let's see who dares!

27:09.321 --> 27:10.982
- Who dares to go in?
- Wait.

27:19.881 --> 27:23.561
Mr. Xu, you are humiliating Miss Meng.

27:23.561 --> 27:26.121
Miss Situ, why do you say that?

27:26.121 --> 27:29.722
Miss Meng is not the kind of woman
who can be swayed by lavish gifts.

27:29.722 --> 27:34.341
You are causing such a massive uproar.
Where does this leave Miss Meng?

27:36.002 --> 27:37.922
Miss Meng, let me explain.

27:37.922 --> 27:39.801
Mr. Xu,

27:39.801 --> 27:42.442
if you continue,
you'll only make things worse.

27:42.442 --> 27:44.722
If you truly want to marry Miss Meng,

27:44.722 --> 27:46.442
why not come to Huiyin House?

27:46.442 --> 27:47.522
I have a plan.

27:47.522 --> 27:49.782
Miss Situ, let's go right away.

27:59.361 --> 28:02.282
Mr. Xu, your betrothal gifts!

28:02.282 --> 28:05.682
They say Lord Xu
has a son with a peculiar mind.

28:05.682 --> 28:07.661
Today, I've finally witnessed it.

28:11.361 --> 28:12.442
You...

28:12.442 --> 28:15.321
Chief Steward You, His Majesty is occupied
with official duties. Don't interrupt him.

28:15.321 --> 28:17.962
Huang Bo, you're being too unreasonable.

28:17.962 --> 28:20.601
Precisely because I know
His Majesty is busy with state affairs,

28:20.601 --> 28:21.881
I came specially to relieve his worries.

28:21.881 --> 28:23.061
Don't stop me.

28:25.121 --> 28:26.401
Chief Steward You,

28:26.401 --> 28:28.482
His Majesty has ordered
that no one is to disturb him.

28:28.482 --> 28:29.922
Don't make things difficult for me.

28:29.922 --> 28:31.922
Wait, am I just anyone?

28:31.922 --> 28:33.482
Others come to annoy His Majesty,

28:33.482 --> 28:35.321
but I'm here to make His Majesty happy.

28:35.321 --> 28:36.922
Let me in.

28:36.922 --> 28:39.321
What are you doing? You...

28:39.321 --> 28:42.422
Your Majesty! Your Majesty!

28:43.960 --> 28:48.762
Your Majesty, I heard
you've been busy with state affairs recently.

28:48.762 --> 28:51.282
I have been preparing
for ten days and ten nights,

28:51.282 --> 28:52.962
just to put on a spectacular show for you.

28:52.962 --> 28:54.061
- Your Majesty, please...
- Let's go.

28:55.801 --> 28:58.321
Alright, I'm coming. Your Majesty.

28:58.321 --> 29:00.182
Begin the dance!

29:28.801 --> 29:31.841
This is the surprise
you prepared for ten days and ten nights?

29:31.841 --> 29:34.720
Your Majesty, isn't it a surprise?

29:34.720 --> 29:37.442
Are you happy? Isn't it unexpected?

29:37.442 --> 29:41.522
These noble ladies
are the most skilled dancers in the capital.

29:41.522 --> 29:44.542
Especially the lady from the Wen family.

29:55.242 --> 29:57.442
You really know me well.

29:57.442 --> 29:58.901
Thank you for your praise.

29:59.682 --> 30:01.801
Your Majesty, you really shouldn't.

30:01.801 --> 30:04.002
These noble ladies
are daughters of high-ranking officials.

30:04.002 --> 30:05.881
If you just leave like this,

30:05.881 --> 30:08.801
will it not break the hearts
of your most loyal officials?

30:08.801 --> 30:13.282
All my painstaking efforts
are for the sake of the empire.

30:13.282 --> 30:16.282
Please have pity on this old bone of mine.

30:16.282 --> 30:19.022
At least watch a little longer, Your Majesty.

30:31.561 --> 30:34.621
I, Wen Ruo Mei,
respectfully wish Your Majesty well.

30:37.520 --> 30:40.482
Greetings, Your Majesty.

30:40.482 --> 30:42.141
Your Majesty,
you're in quite the refined mood.

30:49.042 --> 30:51.581
Your Majesty...

30:55.482 --> 30:57.282
Miss Meng, what a refined taste you have,

30:57.282 --> 30:59.321
to hide away here
and watch them make a fool of me.

30:59.321 --> 31:01.202
I'm wronged!

31:01.202 --> 31:02.881
If I had spoken up rashly,

31:02.881 --> 31:06.482
wouldn't I have spoiled your pleasure
in this garden of competing beauties?

31:06.482 --> 31:08.101
I'll take my leave now.

31:10.242 --> 31:11.321
Too late.

31:11.321 --> 31:13.942
How can one enjoy a show
without paying the price?

31:16.161 --> 31:17.881
Why don't you take the stage too

31:17.881 --> 31:20.484
and exchange some skills
with these noble ladies?

31:20.484 --> 31:22.643
Your Majesty, you're using me again?

31:22.643 --> 31:24.284
If I perform here,

31:24.284 --> 31:25.964
tomorrow at court,

31:25.964 --> 31:28.443
there will surely be a few more memorials
impeaching me for currying favor.

31:28.443 --> 31:30.182
Wouldn't that be perfect?

31:30.182 --> 31:33.264
It will further confirm
that you are my favored subject.

31:34.520 --> 31:37.529
If Your Majesty
wants me to be your favored subject,

31:37.529 --> 31:39.923
then why not
give me a substantive fifth-rank post?

31:39.923 --> 31:42.680
So the name of a sycophant
will be well-deserved.

31:42.680 --> 31:45.440
You're quite the bargainer.

31:45.440 --> 31:47.000
One rank higher,

31:47.000 --> 31:48.700
and I can overpower others by a notch.

31:50.440 --> 31:53.440
I'm going to bear this bad reputation anyway.

31:53.440 --> 31:55.240
I might as well seek a tangible benefit.

31:55.240 --> 31:56.839
Your Majesty, the dance is over.

31:56.839 --> 31:58.800
The noble ladies are all waiting.

31:58.800 --> 32:00.879
I'm in high spirits today.

32:00.879 --> 32:03.680
Then how about this? You compete again.

32:03.680 --> 32:07.699
Whoever wins,
I will keep her to dine with me.

32:12.480 --> 32:13.779
I'll go first.

32:20.359 --> 32:24.359
I once walked among the common folk,
and picked up a mere parlor trick.

32:24.359 --> 32:27.520
It's called Withered Wood Meets Spring.

32:27.520 --> 32:28.980
Please look, Your Majesty.

32:29.760 --> 32:33.160
This bud is about to bloom, like uncut jade.

32:33.160 --> 32:35.319
It contains infinite vitality.

32:35.319 --> 32:37.220
It only lacks a breath of spring breeze.

32:38.119 --> 32:40.680
You're the true dragon,
and the Son of Heaven.

32:40.680 --> 32:43.119
You bear
the imperial aura of the Purple Star.

32:43.119 --> 32:47.400
Please breathe a gentle breath of warm air
onto this flower.

32:47.400 --> 32:50.579
Use this as a catalyst
to awaken its boundless floral spirit.

33:10.519 --> 33:12.519
- It really bloomed!
- It bloomed!

33:12.519 --> 33:13.900
Please look, Your Majesty.

33:14.599 --> 33:18.200
Even humble plants
know to admire and follow the strong.

33:18.200 --> 33:21.000
Feeling the grace of heaven,
they burst with vitality.

33:21.000 --> 33:24.160
This flower bloomed for you.

33:24.160 --> 33:25.299
Very well.

33:26.480 --> 33:30.279
What a splendid Withered Wood Meets Spring,
admiring and following the strong.

33:30.279 --> 33:32.200
Such a performance

33:32.200 --> 33:33.759
far surpasses mere singing and dancing.

33:33.759 --> 33:34.839
Your Majesty,

33:34.839 --> 33:37.044
this is clearly a marketplace trick.

33:37.044 --> 33:38.564
It is not fit for nobles.

33:38.564 --> 33:40.923
His Majesty cares for the people.

33:40.923 --> 33:44.521
This folk amusement
is also a glimpse of the people's life.

33:44.521 --> 33:45.762
Whether all things under heaven

33:45.762 --> 33:48.319
can bask in His Majesty's grace and flourish,

33:48.319 --> 33:50.779
that is the true concern of His Majesty.

33:52.519 --> 33:54.180
Meng Ting Hui, receive the decree.

33:55.559 --> 33:56.759
Effective immediately,

33:56.759 --> 33:58.160
you are promoted
to the rank of Senior Fifth Rank,

33:58.160 --> 34:00.519
and shall
continue to oversee all affairs of Censorate.

34:00.519 --> 34:02.660
Thank you, Your Majesty.

34:06.000 --> 34:08.920
So, Miss Meng,
accompany me back to the Imperial Study

34:08.920 --> 34:10.320
and tell me all about it.

34:10.320 --> 34:13.840
What other amusing tales and hidden wisdom
can be found among the common folk?

34:15.239 --> 34:16.340
Yes.

34:17.440 --> 34:18.760
Your Majesty.

34:18.760 --> 34:20.280
Your Majesty.

34:20.280 --> 34:21.460
Your Majesty.

34:26.239 --> 34:28.239
His Majesty and Miss Meng
have important matters to discuss.

34:28.239 --> 34:30.679
They shouldn't be interrupted.
Please go back.

34:30.679 --> 34:31.920
Ruo Mei.

34:31.920 --> 34:33.840
Such a seductress bewitching His Majesty!

34:33.840 --> 34:36.360
I will definitely
have my father report this to Lord Xu.

34:36.360 --> 34:37.780
How did you do it?

34:38.800 --> 34:41.239
This is my secret.

34:41.239 --> 34:42.980
How can I casually tell others?

35:39.599 --> 35:41.139
Great!

35:47.239 --> 35:48.420
My lady,

35:49.559 --> 35:50.800
what's wrong with you?

35:50.800 --> 35:52.260
You look pale.

35:53.280 --> 35:54.420
My lady.

35:59.159 --> 36:00.940
My lady, what are you looking for?

36:02.480 --> 36:03.619
Ghost.

36:17.480 --> 36:18.940
Xiang!

36:22.679 --> 36:24.239
Let go! Let go of me!

36:24.239 --> 36:26.559
Xiang!

36:26.559 --> 36:30.559
Let go of me!

36:30.559 --> 36:32.480
Let go of me!

36:32.480 --> 36:34.360
Let go of me!

36:34.360 --> 36:37.159
Let go of me!

36:37.159 --> 36:39.940
Xiang!

36:42.039 --> 36:43.760
Xiang!

36:43.760 --> 36:48.480
Xiang!

36:48.480 --> 36:49.760
Enough!

36:49.760 --> 36:51.659
Let go of me!

36:53.960 --> 36:56.119
Release her!

36:56.119 --> 36:57.280
Run!

36:57.280 --> 37:00.340
- Don't come back.
- Xiang!

37:17.000 --> 37:19.719
Why knock at this late hour?

37:19.719 --> 37:23.480
My lady, seeing you distracted
since you returned,

37:23.480 --> 37:25.440
I've been guarding outside.

37:25.440 --> 37:28.679
Just now, I heard shouting inside,

37:28.679 --> 37:29.780
so I...

37:34.719 --> 37:36.500
Investigate someone for me.

37:57.239 --> 37:58.239
Your Majesty,

37:58.239 --> 38:00.840
I've been watching Huiyin House for months
and found nothing unusual.

38:00.840 --> 38:02.199
It's just that
occasionally at the beginning of a month,

38:02.199 --> 38:05.139
musicians would take a convoy to the border
to purchase daily necessities.

38:05.920 --> 38:07.312
Do you truly suspect

38:07.312 --> 38:09.893
those well-trained assassins
are from Huiyin House?

38:09.893 --> 38:11.960
Whether my intuition is right or wrong,

38:11.960 --> 38:13.500
we'll know once we test it.

38:25.080 --> 38:26.360
Steady now.

38:26.360 --> 38:27.760
Alright.

38:27.760 --> 38:29.480
Most of these musicians
come from the common folk.

38:29.480 --> 38:31.980
Knowing a bit of martial arts
isn't that surprising.

38:33.400 --> 38:35.480
What's strange is

38:35.480 --> 38:38.060
too many coincidences coming together.

38:41.080 --> 38:44.099
My lady, I found it.

38:54.199 --> 38:55.680
My lady,

38:55.680 --> 38:57.200
you know this person?

39:42.880 --> 39:44.440
The previous assassination attempt failed

39:44.440 --> 39:46.599
because we underestimated
that shameless emperor.

39:46.599 --> 39:48.760
He has Shen Zhi Shu and Huang Bo
protecting him openly,

39:48.760 --> 39:50.840
and trained elite Shadow Guards in secret.

39:50.840 --> 39:52.280
Mr. Shangguan has ordered

39:52.280 --> 39:53.599
that we have already alerted the enemy,

39:53.599 --> 39:55.280
so the assassination is postponed.

39:55.280 --> 39:56.960
But the great cause cannot be abandoned.

39:56.960 --> 39:58.440
I understand.

39:58.440 --> 40:01.179
In this operation,
we will be extremely cautious.

40:08.920 --> 40:11.380
Mr. He, Mr. Shen.

40:13.360 --> 40:16.079
Miss Situ, after just three days apart,
you are positively glowing.

40:16.079 --> 40:18.304
Your makeup today
mirrors spring water and peach blossoms,

40:18.304 --> 40:19.679
vibrant yet not gaudy,
and refreshingly ethereal.

40:19.679 --> 40:21.079
Mr. Shen, every time you see me,

40:21.079 --> 40:22.749
your flattery flows endlessly

40:22.749 --> 40:24.559
and never repeats. You're truly thoughtful.

40:24.559 --> 40:25.920
I noticed a few musicians

40:25.920 --> 40:28.053
with horses and carriages fully prepared,
looking quite rushed.

40:28.053 --> 40:29.960
Is there some pressing matter?

40:29.960 --> 40:32.599
Just a routine trip to the borderlands
to stock up on incense, fabrics,

40:32.599 --> 40:33.920
and other goods for our shop.

40:33.920 --> 40:37.873
It seems the grand shops in the capital
haven't met your standards.

40:37.873 --> 40:40.440
You must have gone to great lengths
to procure these from the border.

40:40.440 --> 40:41.760
To be honest,

40:41.760 --> 40:45.119
the incense and zither wood
consumed in our music hall are massive,

40:45.119 --> 40:46.400
and the cost is exorbitant.

40:46.400 --> 40:48.360
Since we established mutual trade
with Beijian,

40:48.360 --> 40:50.760
the border supplies
have been of great quality and fairly priced.

40:50.760 --> 40:51.880
I often instruct my musicians

40:51.880 --> 40:54.280
to procure some novel curiosities
from the border

40:54.280 --> 40:55.639
to help attract patrons.

40:55.639 --> 40:58.459
Miss Situ, you are indeed a master of trade.

40:58.459 --> 41:01.880
No wonder Huiyin House has become
the premier establishment in the capital,

41:01.880 --> 41:05.000
frequented by nobles and high officials.

41:05.000 --> 41:06.966
Please don't just stand there.

41:06.966 --> 41:08.920
Tea has been prepared in the quiet chamber.

41:08.920 --> 41:10.480
Let me lead you there.

41:10.480 --> 41:11.699
No rush.

41:12.560 --> 41:15.860
I haven't yet had the chance
to properly admire the sights on this floor.

41:17.519 --> 41:21.019
You little wretch, so eager to see me?
